    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d602-a3">

                <pb facs="0592" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg518"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Fernandez to Mr. Perry</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ferrol,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-03-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 11, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Sr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Encargado</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">de negocios de los Estados Unidos:</hi></p>
                <p>In this moment I received from Paris the following despatch to communicate you. I
                    am advised by the United States consul at [Liverpool that the corsair Florida
                    were paid off on or about 20th February last, at Liverpool, when they received a
                    leave of absence until the 10th instant, when they were to re-embark at Calais
                    on board the Rappahannock.</p>
                <p>A subsequent letter from the same informs me that these men are to be sent to the
                    Stonewall, Ferrol, by sea, on their arrival at Calais. By post I will send to
                    you the original despatch.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
